     "text": [
      "Here are three potential app ideas that utilize OpenAI APIs:\n",
      "\n",
      "**1. AI-Powered Journaling Companion**\n",
      "\n",
      "App Name: Reflect\n",
      "\n",
      "Concept: Create a journaling app that uses OpenAI's natural language processing capabilities to analyze and provide insights on the user's entries. The app could:\n",
      "\n",
      "* Use OpenAI's API to summarize long entries and highlight key themes and emotions\n",
      "* Offer personalized prompts and exercises to help users reflect on their experiences and goals\n",
      "* Provide sentiment analysis and emotional intelligence insights to help users better understand themselves\n",
      "\n",
      "**2. AI-Driven Creative Writing Assistant**\n",
      "\n",
      "App Name: Storycraft\n",
      "\n",
      "Concept: Develop a writing app that leverages OpenAI's language generation capabilities to assist users in generating ideas, outlining stories, and even writing entire drafts. The app could:\n",
      "\n",
      "* Use OpenAI's API to generate plot outlines, character descriptions, and dialogue based on user input\n",
      "* Offer suggestions for plot twists, character arcs, and world-building details\n",
      "* Integrate with popular writing tools like Scrivener or Google Docs to provide a seamless writing experience\n",
      "\n",
      "**3. Personalized Language Learning Companion**\n",
      "\n",
      "App Name: Lingua\n",
      "\n",
      "Concept: Create a language learning app that uses OpenAI's language understanding and generation capabilities to provide personalized lessons and exercises. The app could:\n",
      "\n",
      "* Use OpenAI's API to analyze user language skills and create customized learning plans\n",
      "* Generate interactive lessons, flashcards, and conversational exercises based on user progress\n",
      "* Offer real-time feedback and corrections on user pronunciation, grammar, and vocabulary usage\n",
      "\n",
      "These are just a few ideas, but the possibilities are endless with OpenAI APIs! What specific areas of interest or expertise do you have that might inspire other app ideas?\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "\n",
    "import ollama\n",
    "\n",
    "response = ollama.chat(\n",
    "    model=\"llama3.1:latest\",\n",
    "    messages=[\n",
    "        {\n",
    "            \"role\": \"user\",\n",
    "            \"content\": \"Give me 3 ideas for apps I could build with OpenAI APIs\"\n",
    "        }\n",
    "    ]\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(response[\"message\"][\"content\"])\n",
    "\n"
